<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '20px 64px', flexDirection: 'column', fontFamily: 'Noto Sans SC' }}>

  <Box style={{ height: 96, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-start', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 7 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A', lineHeight: 1.25 }}>
        双系统协同 · 工业质量数据闭环
      </Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
        BOPET 企业质量数据平台 × 工业深度诊断引擎（IDD）—— 从质量记录到根因证据，全链路打通
      </Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', alignItems: 'flex-end', gap: 3, paddingTop: 8 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#94A3B8', fontFamily: 'Cascadia Mono' }}>2 SYSTEMS</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#94A3B8', fontFamily: 'Cascadia Mono' }}>2026</Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ height: 14 }} />

  <Box style={{ height: 280, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 24 }}>

    <Box style={{ width: 564, height: 280, background: '#F8FAFC', border: '1px solid #E2E8F0', borderRadius: 12, overflow: 'hidden', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
      <Box style={{ height: 4, width: '100%', background: '#0D9488' }} />
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, padding: '14px 20px 16px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8 }}>
          <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 18, background: '#0D9488', borderRadius: 2 }} />
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A' }}>BOPET 企业质量数据平台</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ height: 8 }} />
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#64748B' }}>Nuxt 3 全栈 · 客诉与质量问题全流程管理</Text>
        <Box style={{ height: 10 }} />
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 13.5, color: '#0F172A', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
            <span style={{ color: '#0D9488', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>▪ </span>数据记录全生命周期：新建 / 编辑 / 导入 / 导出 / 打印，附件与操作日志全程留痕
          </Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 13.5, color: '#0F172A', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
            <span style={{ color: '#0D9488', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>▪ </span>五维主数据配置：产线 · 客户 · 产品型号 · 责任部门 · 责任工序统一治理
          </Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 13.5, color: '#0F172A', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
            <span style={{ color: '#0D9488', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>▪ </span>多维统计分析：数据概览、月度趋势与五维分布可视化，支撑质量例会决策
          </Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ marginTop: 'auto', flexDirection: 'row', flexWrap: 'wrap', gap: 6 }}>
          {['Nuxt 3', 'Vue 3', 'Naive UI', 'Prisma', 'SQLite / PG', 'ECharts', 'RBAC'].map((t, i) => (
            <Box key={i} style={{ padding: '3px 8px', background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E2E8F0', borderRadius: 6 }}>
              <Text style={{ fontSize: 11.5, color: '#475569', fontFamily: 'Cascadia Mono' }}>{t}</Text>
            </Box>
          ))}
        </Box>
      </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ width: 564, height: 280, background: '#F8FAFC', border: '1px solid #BFDBFE', borderRadius: 12, overflow: 'hidden', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
      <Box style={{ height: 4, width: '100%', background: '#2563EB' }} />
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, padding: '14px 20px 16px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8 }}>
          <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 18, background: '#2563EB', borderRadius: 2 }} />
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A' }}>工业深度诊断引擎 IDD</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ height: 8 }} />
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#64748B' }}>多 Agent × 多 Skill 的可审计根因分析管线</Text>
        <Box style={{ height: 10 }} />
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 13.5, color: '#0F172A', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
            <span style={{ color: '#2563EB', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>▪ </span>Step 0-10 全流程：接入 → 本体 → 统计 + VLM → 诊断 → 评审 → 报告 → 审计 → 交付
          </Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 13.5, color: '#0F172A', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
            <span style={{ color: '#2563EB', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>▪ </span>14 类 Agent × 18 个 Skill，双引擎（OMP / Claude Code）可切换的 harness 抽象
          </Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 13.5, color: '#0F172A', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
            <span style={{ color: '#2563EB', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>▪ </span>质量门禁 CP-1~9 + 证据分级 L1-L7 + 反假相关（时滞 CCF / 辛普森 / 留一杠杆）
          </Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ marginTop: 'auto', flexDirection: 'row', flexWrap: 'wrap', gap: 6 }}>
          {['Node · Express', 'Vue 3 · Vite', 'RAG · ChromaDB', '14 Agents · 18 Skills', 'JWT · Token'].map((t, i) => (
            <Box key={i} style={{ padding: '3px 8px', background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E2E8F0', borderRadius: 6 }}>
              <Text style={{ fontSize: 11.5, color: '#475569', fontFamily: 'Cascadia Mono' }}>{t}</Text>
            </Box>
          ))}
        </Box>
      </Box>
    </Box>

  </Box>

  <Box style={{ height: 18 }} />

  <Box style={{ height: 212, background: '#F1F5F9', borderRadius: 12, border: '1px solid #E2E8F0', padding: '16px 20px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 20 }}>

    <Box style={{ width: 600, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 196, height: 176, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E2E8F0', borderRadius: 8, padding: 4 }}>
        <Image src="assets/bopet_md_temporal.png" style={{ width: '100%', height: '100%', objectFit: 'contain' }} />
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ width: 388, height: 176, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E2E8F0', borderRadius: 8, padding: 4 }}>
        <Image src="assets/idd_mechanism_discrimination.png" style={{ width: '100%', height: '100%', objectFit: 'contain' }} />
      </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 16, background: '#2563EB', borderRadius: 2 }} />
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A' }}>产线质量问题闭环</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, color: '#334155', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>
        客诉 / 异常记录<span style={{ color: '#2563EB' }}> → </span>时序数据上传<span style={{ color: '#2563EB' }}> → </span>深度诊断
        <br />
        <span style={{ color: '#2563EB' }}>→ </span>机理根因<span style={{ color: '#2563EB' }}> → </span>质量改进与验证
      </Text>
      <Box style={{ height: 1, background: '#CBD5E1' }} />
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 48, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#2563EB', fontFamily: 'Cascadia Mono', lineHeight: 1.0 }}>
          0.18
        </Text>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 3 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A' }}>8# 拉伸扭矩 vs 划伤 的 |ρ|</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 11.5, color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
            与熔融缺陷族 ρ≈0.5 显著相关，而与划伤不相关 —— 划伤是独立机理（真实 BOPET 案例）
          </Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
    </Box>

  </Box>

  <Box style={{ marginTop: 'auto', height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#94A3B8' }}>BOPET 质量数据平台 × 工业深度诊断引擎 IDD</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#94A3B8', fontFamily: 'Cascadia Mono' }}>01 / 01</Text>
  </Box>

</Slide>
